{
  "slug": "artist:rotterdam-terror-corps",
  "name": "Rotterdam Terror Corps",
  "editorial_article": "Rotterdam Terror Corps formed in 1993 in Rotterdam as a pioneering gabber act, originally consisting of DJs Distortion, MC Raw, DJ Reanimator, DJ Petrov, and DJ Rob. The group became notorious for incorporating erotic elements into their live shows, including pyrotechnics and performances by strippers. George Ruseler, known as DJ Distortion, serves as the main producer and is the only original member remaining in the act. Over their history, they have maintained a consistent presence on Megarave Records, producing albums such as their 1995 debut Three Wasted Souls and the 2005 release Schizophrenic. The group has frequently collaborated with other scene figures, including Neophyte, Bass-D, and The Headbanger, to further the sound of hard-hitting gabber and hardcore techno.",
